  "instruction": "Assign Hole",
  "output": "    public int assignHole(int[] mices, int[] holes) {\n        // code here\n        Arrays.sort(mices);\n        Arrays.sort(holes);\n        \n        int max=0;\n        for(int i=0;i<mices.length;i++)\n        {\n            int sub=mices[i]-holes[i];\n            \n            max=Math.max(max,Math.abs(sub));\n        }\n        return max;\n    }",
